# Typeforge — optional AI "brain" configuration.
#
# Typeforge works fully offline out of the box: the built-in keyword parser
# turns your instructions into typeface settings, with no key or network.
#
# Add a Claude API key here to unlock richer interpretation of your prompts
# AND analysis of uploaded reference images. Copy this file to ".env" and fill in:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The key is only ever read server-side (by the Vite dev middleware) and is
# never exposed to the browser.

# Your Anthropic API key (https://console.anthropic.com/). Leave blank to stay offline.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model used for interpretation.
# Defaults to claude-opus-4-8. For faster/cheaper interpretation you may set
# claude-haiku-4-5 (vision-capable) or claude-sonnet-4-6.
TYPEFORGE_MODEL=
